# Assets

## lib.js

```js
// a.js
const other = "other";

// a2.js
const thing = "thing";

// lib.js
var foo = "foo";

export { foo, other, thing };

```

## main.js

```js
// main.js
import("./lib.js").then((ns) => [ns.foo, ns.thing]);
import("./lib.js").then(({ ...rest }) => rest.other);

```
